<template><div><h1 id="wiki_main_quest">Main Quest</h1><section><h2 id="details-setup">Survival edition and equipment</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-survival-edition" data-guide-step>This is the endless survival edition, separate from its ten-wave Tortured Path story chapter. Its ordinary battery unlocks use waves 1, 5 and 10. There is no story chapter’s final-wave extraction; plan for continuing waves after setup.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-pap">Three survival batteries: waves 1, 5 and 10</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-survival-batteries" data-guide-step>Charge the green-lit battery with nearby kills at outside lower deck on wave 1, Projector Room from wave 5 and Barracks beside Pack-a-Punch from wave 10. Each stops collecting and extinguishes its light when full. Completing all three unlocks Ubersprengen.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0643.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0643.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 1 survival battery: outside lower deck&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 1 survival battery: outside lower deck&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0643&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0644.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0644.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 5 survival battery: Projector Room&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 5 survival battery: Projector Room&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0644&quot;},{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0645.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0645.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Wave 10 survival battery: Barracks beside Pack-a-Punch&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Wave 10 survival battery: Barracks beside Pack-a-Punch&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0645&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-pap-upgrade">Six valves for the PaP fuse</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-olympus-valve-1" data-guide-step>Interact with the valve across from Pack-a-Punch. All six valves are required; the two in the connecting room are different controls.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0646.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0646.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Valve 1: across from Pack-a-Punch&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Valve 1: across from Pack-a-Punch&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0646&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-olympus-valve-2" data-guide-step>Interact with the valve across from Double Tap. All six valves are required; the two in the connecting room are different controls.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0647.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0647.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Valve 2: across from Double Tap&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Valve 2: across from Double Tap&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0647&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-olympus-valve-3" data-guide-step>Interact with the valve right of Projector screen. All six valves are required; the two in the connecting room are different controls.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0648.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0648.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Valve 3: right of Projector screen&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Valve 3: right of Projector screen&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0648&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-olympus-valve-4" data-guide-step>Interact with the valve left of Cafeteria-to-upper-deck stairs. All six valves are required; the two in the connecting room are different controls.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0649.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0649.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Valve 4: left of Cafeteria-to-upper-deck stairs&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Valve 4: left of Cafeteria-to-upper-deck stairs&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0649&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-olympus-valve-5" data-guide-step>Interact with the valve small Cafeteria–Barracks room. All six valves are required; the two in the connecting room are different controls.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0650.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0650.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Valve 5: small Cafeteria–Barracks room&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Valve 5: small Cafeteria–Barracks room&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0650&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-olympus-valve-6" data-guide-step>Interact with the valve same small room left of bed-room stairs. All six valves are required; the two in the connecting room are different controls.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0651.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0651.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Valve 6: same small room left of bed-room stairs&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Valve 6: same small room left of bed-room stairs&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:2560,&quot;height&quot;:1440,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0651&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-olympus-fuse" data-guide-step>After all six, collect the fuse on the PaP-room floor by the bed-room door. This enables Tesla, Ripsaw and melee special upgrades at Ubersprengen.</li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-sword">Sword unlock: seven 1,750-Jolt payments</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-sword-prerequisite" data-guide-step>Complete the full Tortured Path main quest at least once on the profile before attempting this Sword route. Budget 12,250 Jolts for seven separate payments; completing this survival map’s Pack-a-Punch alone does not grant that campaign prerequisite.</li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-1" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at life jacket on floor before Quick Revive. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0652.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0652.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 1: life jacket on floor before Quick Revive&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 1: life jacket on floor before Quick Revive&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0652&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-2" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at boxes right of Grease Gun. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0653.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0653.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 2: boxes right of Grease Gun&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 2: boxes right of Grease Gun&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0653&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-3" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at lower-deck beam left of Mystery Box. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0654.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0654.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 3: lower-deck beam left of Mystery Box&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 3: lower-deck beam left of Mystery Box&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0654&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-4" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at lower-deck rope pile near Mystery Box. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0655.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0655.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 4: lower-deck rope pile near Mystery Box&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 4: lower-deck rope pile near Mystery Box&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0655&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-5" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at bucket right of Projector screen. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0656.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0656.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 5: bucket right of Projector screen&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 5: bucket right of Projector screen&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0656&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-6" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at connecting-room wall drawer; drop Jolts on floor before it. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0657.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0657.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 6: connecting-room wall drawer; drop Jolts on floor before it&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 6: connecting-room wall drawer; drop Jolts on floor before it&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0657&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-site-7" data-guide-step>Drop 1,750 Jolts at under the bed right of Pack-a-Punch. The rune accepts the money and glows purple when paid; a nearby payment that remains on the floor has not registered.<GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0658.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0658.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 7: under the bed right of Pack-a-Punch&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword payment 7: under the bed right of Pack-a-Punch&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0658&quot;}]' /></li>
<li id="guide-step-sword-down" data-guide-step>After all seven payments, stand in the glowing ring in front of Quick Revive and deliberately let a zombie down you. The scripted instant revive gives Sword. Other perks remain, but solo Quick Revive is lost; this intentional ritual has different consequences from the Frozen Dawn Shield trial.<p class="guide-callout">Perform the intentional down only inside the activated glowing ring.</p><GuideIllustrations :images='[{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/asset-0659.webp&quot;,&quot;previewSrc&quot;:&quot;/images/remaining/preview/asset-0659.webp&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;Sword ritual glowing ring&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;Sword ritual glowing ring&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;mmmrkennedy; game imagery Activision and the relevant game studio&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:3840,&quot;height&quot;:2160,&quot;source&quot;:&quot;https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide&quot;,&quot;assetId&quot;:&quot;asset-0659&quot;}]' /></li></ol></section>
<section><h2 id="details-survival">Maintain armour, ammunition and a retreat route</h2><ol><li id="guide-step-survival-loop" data-guide-step>Keep an upgraded weapon with a reliable refill route, armour and room to retreat before using Ubersprengen or purchasing perks. Save tactical distractions for a cornered player or revive. Completing the fuse/Sword routes improves equipment; it does not end this survival match.</li></ol></section><section><h2 id="guide-sources">Sources and review</h2><p>Source-reviewed on 8 October 2026, using the references below and the research handoff. These instructions and puzzle calculations have software checks; they have not been verified in a complete in-game playthrough. Record symbols, sequences and completion cues from your match. Screenshot and community-chart creators are credited with each illustration.</p><ul><li><a href="https://mmmrkennedy.com/games/WW2/the_tortured_path/survival_maps/uss_mount_olympus_guide" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">mmmrkennedy illustrated guide ↗</a></li>
